## 📌 Overview

A **fully interactive Environmental Health Dashboard** that analyzes air and water quality data across 15 major global cities using the **IQAir 2025 World Air Quality Report** — covering 9,446 cities across 143 countries.

The tool goes beyond just showing AQI numbers — it translates pollution data into **personal health impact**: how the air affects your lungs, sleep, energy, skin, and hair.

---

## ✨ Features

### 📊 Key Metrics
- Average AQI across analyzed cities
- Highest & Lowest AQI city
- Number of cities analyzed
- Environmental Health Score (0–100)
- Average Water Quality Index

### 📈 Interactive Visualizations
- AQI Comparison Bar Chart (15 cities)
- PM2.5 Levels Chart (µg/m³)
- PM10 Levels Chart (µg/m³)
- City Environmental Score Ranking (horizontal bar)
- AQI Category Distribution (Doughnut chart)

### 🎛 Interactive Filters
| Filter | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| City Selector | Choose any of 15 global cities |
| AQI Range Slider | Filter cities by AQI range (0–300) |
| Pollutant Focus | Toggle between AQI / PM2.5 / PM10 |
| Health Risk Filter | Show Good / Moderate / Poor cities only |
| Compare Mode | Side-by-side city comparison |

### 🏙 City Detail Cards
Each city card shows:
- AQI value with color-coded category
- PM2.5 & PM10 readings
- Air Quality Score, Water Quality Score, Overall Score
- Health bar with environmental grade

### 🚦 AQI Categories
| Category | AQI Range | Color |
|----------|-----------|-------|
| Good | 0 – 50 | 🟢 Green |
| Satisfactory | 51 – 100 | 🟡 Light Green |
| Moderate | 101 – 150 | 🟠 Yellow |
| Poor | 151 – 200 | 🔴 Orange |
| Very Poor | 201 – 300 | ❗ Red |
| Severe | 300+ | ☠️ Dark Red |

### 🫁 Health Impact Analysis
For any selected city, the dashboard explains the impact on:

**Air Quality → Body:**
- Lung & Respiratory Health
- Sleep Quality
- Energy Levels
- Exercise Performance
- Long-term Health Risk

**Water Quality → Appearance:**
- Hair Fall Risk
- Hair Dryness
- Scalp Health
- Skin Dryness
- Acne Tendency
- Sensitive Skin Impact

Each metric uses risk indicators: 🟢 Low · 🟡 Moderate · 🔴 High

### 📋 Personal Report Card
- Environmental Health Score (0–100)
- Air Quality Score with Grade (A–F)
- Water Quality Score with Grade (A–F)
- Hair Risk Grade
- Skin Risk Grade
- Animated score rings (SVG)

### 💡 Insights Panel
- Top 3 Cleanest Cities
- Top 3 Most Polluted Cities
- Biggest Anomaly (Delhi PM2.5 spike: 460 µg/m³)
- Most Surprising Global Observation
- Executive Summary

### 🛡 Personalised Recommendations
- Daily Actions
- Indoor Air Improvements
- Outdoor Activity Guidance
- Hair Care Recommendations
- Skin Care Recommendations
- Water Quality Improvements

> Recommendations dynamically change based on the selected city's AQI and water quality scores.

