## 📡 Data Sources

| Source | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| [IQAir 2025 World Air Quality Report](https://www.iqair.com/world-air-quality-report) | PM2.5 data from 9,446 cities · 143 countries |
| WHO/UNICEF JMP 2025 | Water quality scores |
| WHO PM2.5 Guideline | Annual average: 5 µg/m³ |

**Data Quality:**
- Missing values imputed using regional averages
- PM2.5 validated against WHO annual guidelines
- Water quality scores cross-referenced with WHO/UNICEF JMP dataset

