## 🔑 Key Insights from Data

> 🔴 **Only 14% of global cities** met the WHO PM2.5 annual guideline in 2025 — down from 17% in 2024.

> 🌍 Delhi AQI **186** vs Reykjavik AQI **8** — a **23× difference** in the air people breathe daily.

> ⚡ New Delhi PM2.5 spiked to **460 µg/m³** during November 2025 — **92× the WHO guideline**.

> 🏆 Only **13 countries** worldwide met WHO clean air standards — all are island nations or Nordic countries.

